## --- ProtectorateOS Foundation Nano Configuration ---

## Display
set linenumbers
set indicator
set constantshow
set stateflags
set minibar

## Editing
set tabsize 4
set tabstospaces
set autoindent
set smarthome
set trimblanks

## Searching
set casesensitive

## UX
set historylog

## Backups
set locking

## Syntax highlighting
include "/usr/share/nano/*.nanorc"
